# Staging area for receipt photos being added to the corpus. Real receipts
# carry a business's name, address and purchases — they stay off the remote.
backend/tests/ocr-accuracy/inbox/
# Live feedback output, UNLIKE the corpus reports above, which are tracked.
# These are generated from real confirmed receipts: the recurring-error tables
# name the vendors an owner buys from and the items they bought. Same rule as
# the inbox — real transaction data stays off the remote. Regenerate locally
# with live-feedback-report.ts whenever it is needed.
backend/tests/ocr-accuracy/LIVE-FEEDBACK-REPORT.md
backend/tests/ocr-accuracy/live-feedback.json

